OL,3,GNEWSATeacher says pupil lied about sex
OL,4,A'to look cool'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA PE teacher accused of having a sexual
OL,7,Frelationship with a pupil says she
OL,8,Fbelieves the boy made up the
OL,9,Fallegations "to look cool in front of
OL,10,Fhis mates".
OL,12,FBronwen James, 30, of Chippenham, in
OL,13,FWiltshire, is accused of four charges
OL,14,Fof sexual activity with a 16-year-old
OL,15,Fboy at Bitterne Park School, in
OL,16,FSouthampton, Hampshire, in 2022.
OL,18,FShe denies they had sex or exchanged
OL,19,Fflirtatious messages, but told the
OL,20,Fongoing trial at Winchester Crown Court
OL,21,Fshe was "aware there was a rumour" of
OL,22,Fflirting between them at the time.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
