OL,3,GNEWSATeacher says pupil lied about sex
OL,4,A'to look cool'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames admitted that the boy did come to
OL,7,Fher house on one occasion for five
OL,8,Fminutes, but that it was just a toilet
OL,9,Fstop and to drop her dog off before she
OL,10,Fgave him a lift home from town.
